# W7e, host a (k10): with b on stag0101's matz02 (both parked at the barrier) its link is cut for 20 s.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
route {route:stag0101_west}
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control or epoch>=@330
log a arrived in stag0102
wander 330 140 15 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail stage=stagml11
log a joined b there, still host
